      "expectation": "Probe repeats PostgreSQL SELECT 1/Redis PONG and bounded real listener readiness; unavailable service fails nonzero. Real HTTP create 201/Location; owned GET/list/cancel 200 JSON, 401 WWW-Authenticate, 404 foreign IDs, 400 invalid terms and 503 safe failure. With actual new Oban workers, assert quote-triggered executed state with exact price/purchase ID, price-pending, both rejection reasons, expiry without quote, unchanged terms and no GET/list writes/jobs. Lost PubSub/reconnect returns identical outcome; duplicate/recovered jobs yield one purchase, one transfer, two balanced ledger entries, nonnegative balances and conserved supply 100."
